     "source_line": "🔹🔹🔹WALF Devon welcomes you to its 8th Edition of Winter Afro-Latin Festival. Join us as we celebrate with a collaboration of SALSA, BACHATA, KIZOMBA , URBANKIZ & AFRO-HOUSE and many more with incredible line up of both International and Local Teachers, and Dj’s to keep you entertained all the weekend. We will have 4 dance floors available, a late licence and late bar to allow you to keep dancing and drinking through the night."
